    <profile name="Gun Emplacement" id="d569c285-1f50-c732-0fdc-0dc1c6781cf1" hidden="false" page="0" publicationId="2be8d152--pubN235739" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">One non-vehicle model in base contact with a gun emplacement can fire it instead of his own weapon, following the normal rules for shooting (note that a model firing a gun-emplacement always counts as being stationary, even if it moved in its preceding Movement phase). A model in cover behind a gun emplacement has a 4+ cover save. The gun emplacement can be shot at and attacked in close combat. It is hit automatically in close combat.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
