    <profile name="Temporal Distort (Psychic)" id="15fa99a3-a863-8d9c-1873-a3343199460d" hidden="false" page="0" publicationId="2be8d152--pubN100814" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Blessing or Malediction, Warp Charge 3. The power must be manifested at the start of the Sanctioned Psyker Battle Elite&apos;s turn. Nominate a unit within 36&quot; of a model from the Psychic Choir. If it is an enemy unit, that unit may not charge in its next turn. If it is a friendly unit, that unit adds 6 to its Run moves (usually D6+6&quot;) and adds +2D6 to its charge distance (usually 4D6&quot;) until the start of the manifesting unit&apos;s next turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
