        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When a model carrying Volkov&apos;s Cane issues an order to a unit within 6&quot;, the Leadership test will only fail on a roll of a double 6.</characteristic>
